##
## Title-
##       ~/src/cpp/Clone/.README
##
## Purpose-
##       README information file.
##
## Last change date-
##       2026/07/06
##
## Implementation notes-
##       This package provides similar functionality to rsync.
##       Prefer rsync when copying many or large files.
##       Prefer this package for smaller update sets or when you want to be
##       more careful about copying into or from the correct subdirectory.
##
##       Run rdserver from the subdirectory you want to copy from, and
##       run rdclient in the subdirectory you want to copy into.
##       See RdClient.cpp and RdServer.cpp for option information.
##
